**Case Study Instructions**

You should prepare a PowerPoint presentation designed for a senior executive audience.

The presentation should be structured, concise, and focused on both strong analytics and strategic recommendations.

Please ensure your presentation:

Clearly outlines the data analysis you conducted
Highlights key findings and insights
Explicitly states any assumptions you have made
Explains how you would validate these assumptions if implemented
Includes a clear Executive Summary slide with recommendations
Most new features launched on the Agoda website aim to increase the number of bookings. One way to improve conversion is by encouraging customers to complete their bookings quickly through a call-to-action known internally as an “urgency message.”

Examples:

“Prices have been rising. Book now to lock in your rates!”
“Your check-in is fast approaching. Book now to lock in your rates!”
A Product Owner would like to explore implementing urgency messaging and has requested an analysis to understand how prices move as the booking date approaches the check-in date, and what business opportunities may arise from these findings.

Attached is a randomly sampled dataset from five different cities with check-in dates between 01/10/2016 – 31/12/2016.

There is no limitation on tools or technology for this analysis.

Important Guidance for This Round

Please note that historically, the majority of candidates did not pass the case review stage. We strongly encourage you to put in extra effort for this assignment 😊.

Based on previous reviews, cases typically fell short due to:

Weak or incomplete exploratory data analysis (EDA)
Lack of depth and generality in the approach
Limited or incorrect use of statistical methods
Analysis not clearly connected to recommendations
To strengthen your submission, please ensure you include:

✅ A clear Executive Summary
✅ Thorough Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) (this is a must-have)
✅ A well-structured and professional deck
✅ Clear, data-driven conclusions and recommendations
✅ An assessment of business impact
Senior leadership will be looking not only at what you found, but also how rigorously you arrived at your conclusions and how clearly you translate analysis into business decisions.

Points to Consider

You may reflect on (but are not limited to) the following:

At which stage of the funnel should urgency messaging be implemented?
(Homepage, search results page, property page, or booking form?)
What assumptions are you making?
What factors influence price movement?
What limitations exist in the dataset?
What additional data would strengthen the analysis?
