What recommendations would you provide to the Product Owner?
Presentation Expectations

If shortlisted, you will have approximately 30 minutes to present your findings and recommendations to management, followed by approximately 30 minutes of Q&A.

To support your preparation:

Build a compelling narrative — not just analysis slides
Focus on the “so what?” for each slide
Provide clear, top-down, actionable recommendations
Maintain clarity, confidence, and executive presence
Our management team is highly analytical and data-driven, so accuracy, logical reasoning, and structured thinking are essential.

Data Dictionary

# – Number of records in each dataset
ADR – Average Daily Rate in USD (Customer Total Amount / Room Nights)
Hotel ID – Property identification number
City ID – City identification number
Star Rating – Property star rating
Accommodation Type Name – Property’s accommodation type
Chain Hotel – Indicates whether the property is part of a chain
Booking Date – Date the booking was made
Check-in Date – Date of check-in
Check-out Date – Date of check-out
